# NVS seed for WiFi credentials — copy to wifi_creds.csv (gitignored), put your
# real network in it, then generate + flash the nvs partition (see README.md).
# Format is the ESP-IDF nvs_partition_gen CSV.
key,type,encoding,value
wifi,namespace,,
ssid,data,string,YourNetworkName
pass,data,string,YourPassword
